  "id": "daff15a6-c14e-4bec-8733-2e6957c8a35b",
  "title": "Unified 3D Generation and Understanding Frameworks",
  "summary": "DreamOmni3 enables flexible 3D editing and generation using scribble-based tasks, while TASE improves 3D scene understanding and editing through truncation-aware embeddings, and Hunyuan3D-Buffalo 1.0 offers a scalable solution combining multimodal models for 3D understanding, generation, and editing. ELSA3D introduces a unified 3D model that addresses text-3D interaction by structuring language and geometric reasoning jointly, while OctLLM introduces a sparse octree-based 3D language.",
